  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP12-1 — Together\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Collective Release / Quiet Union"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    {\"@id\": \"character:nero-ops\"},\n    {\"@id\": \"ghost:compliance-ogre\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The final cue, quietly. I tap kagura; Hibiki settles the breathing. Kaede watches the ward. Nei-chan’s light spreads; the city’s contours soften a little."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I am.”\nThe words belong to no one. Fear lets go, relation stands up. Nero departs—not a victory. A return."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Morning on the canal. I write one line in my notebook: “We can’t put it together. It is together.”\nAnd I draw a small ‘tree’ on the corner of the page."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look at everyone—Kaede, Hibiki, Nei-chan—our gazes meet and loosen, naturally."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Together.” With that one word, the room brightens. Water answers in the distance."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look at my friends in turn. The crease in Kaede’s brow unwinds; Hibiki drops the band one notch. Nei-chan’s light lays quiet margins along the streets."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep12/part1.en:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A final line in the notebook: ‘We can’t put it together. It is together.’ —We have finally caught up to that fact."
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:51+09:00"
}